## Interface: 16001
## Title: GoldFinder Forever
## Notes: Decide si vender, subastar o guardar lo que llevas, con paneles en el vendedor, la subasta, el correo y las profesiones. Nada se vende ni se publica sin tu clic.
## Notes-enUS: Decides whether to vendor, auction or keep what you carry, with panels at the merchant, auction house, mailbox and professions. Nothing is sold or posted without your click.
